      "spam": false,
      "value": "As currently suggested, this would be potentially open for abuse as uploaded images would go live immediately. For avatars which only show up in worlds this might be okay, but for worlds that might show up prominently in other player's menus it could be a problem.\n\nAt the very least, updated world preview images would have to be vetted before going live.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
