      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{5a0220ed7add6132ccf19b36|full_name}: I see no issue with images being vetted. Even the avatar images should be. It'd just be nice if I could correct a poor angle, or broken image, without have to resubmit for public use, especially if there's a large chance the image will break again, and I'd need to submit the avatar\\world to be reviewed again.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
